# SETU has two separate .env files — one per service. This root file is
# just a pointer so you don't go looking for a single combined one.
#
#   backend/.env.example   — copy to backend/.env  (database, JWT, AI/speech/
#                             telephony/notification provider keys)
#   frontend/.env.example  — copy to frontend/.env  (optional API base URL
#                             override; not needed for local dev)
#
# Both real .env files are gitignored. Never commit real secrets to either.
